<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">SpikingMamba: Towards Energy-Efficient Large Language
<br class="ltx_break">Models via Knowledge Distillation from Mamba</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Yulong Huang  </span><span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">yhuang496@connect.hkust-gz.edu.cnThe Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (Guangzhou)</span>
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Jianxiong Tang  </span><span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">jiatang@cityu.edu.hkDepartment of Computer Science, City University of Hong Kong</span>
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
