<td id="S2.T1.5.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">SpikeGPT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib59" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhu et al. (2023)</a></cite></td>
<td id="S2.T1.5.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">216 M</td>
