<td id="S4.T2.13.1.1.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="8"><span id="S4.T2.13.1.1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Zero-shot Accuracy (%) (<math id="S4.T2.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.13.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
